  DisplayName: Classical Vases Back in Fashion
  EventType: 1
  Description: A much-admired drawing room in the capital {has been|will be} done
    in the classical manner, and the illustrated papers {are copying|will copy} it
    page by page. Every hostess {wants|will want} a pair of vases on the chimneypiece,
    and the older Italian pieces {are|will be} the ones to have.
